  {
    "annotations": {
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": true,
      "readOnlyHint": true,
    },
    "description": "Read Discord’s own audit log — who changed what and when.

Requires ViewAuditLog. This is Discord’s log, not this server’s; use it to find out what
