  {
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": true,
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": false,
    },
    "description": "Revoke a profile and delete its stored tokens.

Irreversible: the user must authorize again to restore it. The stored access and refresh
tokens are deleted rather than only flagged, so nothing remains that could be resurrected.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$",
          "title": "profile name",
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "name",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "discord_oauth_profile_revoke",
    "title": "Revoke a Discord OAuth2 profile",
  },
  {
    "annotations": {
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": true,
      "readOnlyHint": true,
    },
    "description": "Compute effective permissions for a member (or this bot) in a guild or channel, and explain
which role or overwrite produced each important allow and deny.

Call this after any permission failure instead of retrying with different arguments. Retrying
a 403 cannot succeed and repeated rejections are rate-limited by this server before they reach
Discord. Returns permission names, never raw bitfields.

Requires the bot to be in the guild. Reads only; it changes nothing.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "channelId": {
          "description": "Include channel overwrites. Omit for guild-level permissions only.",
          "examples": [
            "123456789012345678",
          ],
          "pattern": "^\\d{17,21}$",
          "title": "Snowflake",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "check": {
          "description": "Permission names to explain specifically, e.g. ["ManageRoles","SendMessages"]. Each gets a sentence naming the role or overwrite responsible.",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "type": "array",
        },
        "guildId": {
          "description": "A Discord ID: 17-21 decimal digits, always a string.",
          "examples": [
            "123456789012345678",
          ],
          "pattern": "^\\d{17,21}$",
          "title": "Snowflake",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "memberId": {
          "description": "Whose permissions to compute. Defaults to this bot — usually what you want after a 403.",
          "examples": [
            "123456789012345678",
          ],
          "pattern": "^\\d{17,21}$",
          "title": "Snowflake",
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "guildId",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "discord_permissions_explain",
    "title": "Explain effective permissions",
  },
  {
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": false,
      "idempotentHint": true,
      "openWorldHint": true,
    },
    "description": "Give or take a role from a guild member.

Requires ManageRoles, and the role must be strictly below the bot’s highest role — Discord
refuses otherwise, and no retry will change that. Call discord_permissions_explain on a 403.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "action": {
          "enum": [
            "add",
            "remove",
          ],
          "type": "string",
        },
        "auditLogReason": {
          "description": "Recorded in the guild audit log. Say why, not what.",
          "maxLength": 512,
          "type": "string",
        },
        "guildId": {
          "description": "A Discord ID: 17-21 decimal digits, always a string.",
          "examples": [
            "123456789012345678",
          ],
          "pattern": "^\\d{17,21}$",
          "title": "Snowflake",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "roleId": {
          "description": "A Discord ID: 17-21 decimal digits, always a string.",
          "examples": [
            "123456789012345678",
          ],
          "pattern": "^\\d{17,21}$",
          "title": "Snowflake",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "userId": {
          "description": "A Discord ID: 17-21 decimal digits, always a string.",
          "examples": [
            "123456789012345678",
          ],
          "pattern": "^\\d{17,21}$",
          "title": "Snowflake",
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "guildId",
        "userId",
        "roleId",
        "action",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "discord_role_assign",
    "title": "Add or remove a role from a member",
  },
  {
    "annotations": {
      "destructiveHint": false,
      "idempotentHint": false,
      "openWorldHint": true,
    },
    "description": "Create a guild role with named permission flags.

Requires ManageRoles. Discord will not let a bot grant permissions it does not itself hold —
if this fails, call discord_permissions_explain to see what the bot actually has.
The new role is created below the bot’s highest role.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "auditLogReason": {
          "description": "Recorded in the guild audit log. Say why, not what.",
          "maxLength": 512,
          "type": "string",
        },
        "color": {
          "description": "A decimal integer. Write 0x5865f2 in source; Discord receives 5793266.",
          "maximum": 16777215,
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer",
        },
        "guildId": {
          "description": "A Discord ID: 17-21 decimal digits, always a string.",
          "examples": [
            "123456789012345678",
          ],
          "pattern": "^\\d{17,21}$",
          "title": "Snowflake",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "hoist": {
          "type": "boolean",
        },
        "mentionable": {
          "type": "boolean",
        },
        "name": {
          "maxLength": 100,
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string",
        },
        "permissions": {
          "items": {
            "description": "A permission name such as "ManageRoles". Raw bitfields are not accepted.",
            "maxLength": 64,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string",
          },
          "type": "array",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "guildId",
        "name",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "discord_role_create",
    "title": "Create a role",
  },
